# Pairs with NoCrossTenantMembership. Without the exact-id screen a subject
# whose id is literally another tenant's group matches that group's entry.
MODULE: ExactIdMatchesGroupShapedSubject
TARGET: NoCrossTenantMembership
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: the exact-id probe matches a subject id shaped like a tenant group
PERTURBS: Count

--- FIND
        exact == {e \in Entries : e = subj /\ ~IsTier(subj) /\ live(e)}
--- REPLACE
        exact == {e \in Entries : e = subj /\ live(e)}
--- END